@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
InitialState --> ProcessRunning : Start Process
ProcessRunning --> ProcessCompleted : Complete Successfully
ProcessRunning --> ProcessError : Error Occurs
ProcessError --> ProcessUndo : Undo Process
ProcessUndo --> ProcessCorrected : Correct Error
ProcessCorrected --> ProcessRunning : Resume Process
ProcessCompleted --> [*] : End Process
@enduml
